code-orchestrator
------------------------

An architect -> coder -> tester setup for OpenCode and FuckCode v2.

The orchestrator plans, writes a spec and reviews the diff. The coder
implements the spec. The tester runs build, lint and tests. Workers run
in isolated sub-sessions, so their noise does not fill the orchestrator
context.

Files:

.opencode/agents/orchestrator.md   primary, cannot edit files
.opencode/agents/coder.md          subagent, implements the spec
.opencode/agents/tester.md         subagent, runs checks
opencode.jsonc                     default agent for this repository
install.sh                         global install for both tools


Install
------------------------

Requires OpenCode v2+ or FuckCode v2+ and a configured model provider.

git clone https://github.com/NoNFake/code-orchestrator.git
cd code-orchestrator
./install.sh

The installer symlinks the agents into ~/.config/opencode/agents and
~/.config/fuckcode/agents for each config directory it finds. Real files
with the same name are not overwritten. Updates come with git pull.

To start new sessions in the orchestrator, add to the root object of
~/.config/opencode/opencode.jsonc and ~/.config/fuckcode/fuckcode.jsonc:

"default_agent": "orchestrator"

Without it, pick the agent with shift+tab or ctrl+x a.
Run `opencode reload` or `fuckcode reload` after changing config.


Models
------------------------

Each agent has its own model in the frontmatter. The defaults use the
opencode-go provider:

orchestrator   opencode-go/gemini-4-hydrogen
coder          opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash
tester         opencode-go/claude-haiku-5-5

Change the model line in the agent file, or set it per project in
opencode.jsonc under agents. Use one place, not both.
List available models with: opencode models


Usage
------------------------

cd ~/projects/myapp
opencode

Then describe the task as usual:

Fix the checkout crash on an empty cart and add a regression test.

The orchestrator reads the code, sends a spec to coder, reviews git diff
and runs tester when needed. Press down to open the subagent picker and
enter to watch a worker session.


Update and remove
------------------------

cd ~/code-orchestrator && git pull

rm ~/.config/opencode/agents/{orchestrator,coder,tester}.md
rm ~/.config/fuckcode/agents/{orchestrator,coder,tester}.md
